many seeks may be incurred before space is available for a subse‐
quent higher priority write.  Issuers of throttleable I/O  should
attempt  to  issue their writes sequentially or to locations in a
single small area of the drive (i.e. different positions  in  the
same  file)  to  ensure  good  spacial locality.  The command can
